    }
  ],
  "evidence_gaps": [
    "No direct oral bioavailability measurement for the query molecule.",
    "No matched oral versus IV AUC data for the query.",
    "No query-specific Caco-2/PAMPA or human absorption data; L4 records are for reference molecules.",
    "No fasted-state-specific experimental data for the query.",
    "C19 is a close but not identical analogue and its low-F outcome is qualitative.",
    "Lisinopril's 25% absorption indicates low permeability can still permit F≥20% in some zwitterions, but transferability to the query is uncertain."
